{"id":"603b78700e219950","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-d1-from-prf.md","title":"D1 from Proof Predicate","display":"prop-d1-from-prf — D1 from Proof Predicate","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-d1-from-prf","aliases":["92-prop-d1-from-prf"],"display":"prop-d1-from-prf — D1 from Proof Predicate","depends_on":["[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 106，P1（PDF 123）","source_status":"原书定理的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-d1-from-prf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-d1-from-prf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-d1-from-prf — D1 from Proof Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c268cc9a199d00a\" href=\"?note=5c268cc9a199d00a\" title=\"92-lem-derivability-conditions\">92-lem-derivability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 106，P1（PDF 123）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书定理的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> (external proof-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (internal proof and provability formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}d1\\text{-}from\\text{-}prf}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\n\\land G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}d1\\text{-}from\\text{-}prf}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\n\\land G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D1\">\\(D1\\)</span>的可推导性条件</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证，则存在证明序列<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>编码一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明，则外部关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>成立</li>\n<li>对标准的内部表示公式，闭实例应写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\bar k,v_1),\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},v_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\bar k,v_1),\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},v_0)\\)</span>，而不能把外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span>直接喂给对象语言numeral</li>\n<li>标准证明检查公式的正确正实例可在固定PA系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中验证；再作存在引入便得到内部可证性公式</li>\n<li>即<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>取实际证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>。所选公式的正数码实例可证条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\bar k)\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\bar k)\\)</span>；存在引入得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。仅在标准模型中正确，并不能替代这一步内部验证。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 106，P1（PDF 123）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ (external proof-code predicate, see [[92-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ and $\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (internal proof and provability formulas, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}d1\\text{-}from\\text{-}prf}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\n\\land G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"D1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G,\\bar k,v_1),\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G;\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},\\bar k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":2181,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-333","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-d1-from-prf]]"}],"outgoing":["5c268cc9a199d00a","7e21e34fc6bec397","e9cc91aaee998c7b","b78092e29a02d697","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6"]}